{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "全述起信唯識二論同異耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "成事智有諍可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "基師云爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丘龍\n云爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "深有大味，思准可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此意根量作法，丘龍和上，處處異出。今依基師二障章，作如是立耳。合喻如常知之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是等類，亦不通心一種所生，由見相種各別體故。五聚法中，心、心所色，此等法或時有實用\n故，必有各別法爾種子。若心緣彼，分明現前，不待推求，亦非過、未。純以自種相分體生，不關他種，名性境轉。識\n中影雖無實用，純自因生，名為真實法。樞要後文，緣他地法，無自本質。然准此文，從別種生，識現初禪，境自地\n繫。繫不隨心，此文定故。彼若以他法為質，彼見何緣？自無質故。謂生上界，不起定通，亦得明見下地諸色。下色\n非自業，及定通果故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太賢集云：且龜毛等無法爾種子，〔名〕有法爾，應如色等。或時容有，生本法故。無為亦爾。其他界\n法雖有容生，下染緣上，〔亦〕不分明，但以名字推求。而盧無力〔繫〕發上種生影，但以分別所立之影，種無從見，性\n\n繫必同，非上緣上分明取故。此中等取密蘊，計我法漏無漏類眾多，故言等也。種子六義引自果者，屬正生門，\n非傍生故，不相違也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太賢集云：非現證境推求力生故。從見種說通有覆，而有本質\n似質而生故。從質種說通無有覆，以得熏生本質種故。問：能熏之影既通二性，所熏種子亦應通二。既六義中\n種現性同，所生賴耶豈通有覆？答：唯從質分熏種，非餘從見之分，如獨影故。謂從見種故不熏質，不似見故亦\n不熏見。其無覆邊，從本質種似本而起，得熏本質。未詳決云：六七我執無所似故，名為獨影，唯染不熏。第八識\n種不同性故，非也。行相雖倒有質，質影都無所爾，不應理故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太賢集云：心所所緣是獨影者，任運酬業隨識而轉，麤細既等無勝助緣，唯自\n見分似彼而生。異熟五識自性麤動有勝助力，謂同境根同緣意識，由此擊發本識中種，令生自心現行相分。\n若種子影純從種生，應成現行相不相似，既似種故從心別起，唯此五數唯獨影。此師意也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太賢集云：五識所緣實唯性境，心託本生假名帶質，雖言帶質性不交雜，\n不待推求分明現證，自種子生不從見故。緣過未蘊現無本質假名獨影，而從過未質種而生，熏生彼類故帶\n質攝，由分別力不名性境。且如金剛心所現鏡智影，無現本質名為獨影，然從境智法爾種生，熏自新種亦名\n帶質。證師云：由帶現在有漏〔八五〕緣未來故，得熏無漏作鏡智種，若無現在自類法者不熏彼種。非也。有漏為\n質熏無漏種，現相違故。第八識慧等心所既無種現，質應不熏，故意識品種所生獨影熏生第八，不應理故。他\n法為質種不相關，不共內法不〔託〕熏故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太賢集云：隨定所思\n金銀等影，果色隨起假名帶質。有說同時一種通生境果二色名為帶質，不同眼識中影與質各別種生名性\n境故。非也。勿無漏定所引之果必異種生，非帶質故。業所生器雖他為質，種不相關，不名帶質。定果不爾，定境\n熏果色故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太賢集云：以何為證\n有此三境？照師云：唯無聖教正理為量。和上云：瑜伽七十三說：復有餘二種相，先分別所生及相所生、共所成\n相。云何影像相？謂遍計所起、勝解所現，非住本性相。解云：先分別生，謂能緣相。相所生者，性境。共所成者，帶質\n也。影像相者，獨影也。就由他種生言，非住本相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太賢集云：此不應理。無法影若從所無色等種生，非無影故。若無法\n爾，影必無力，非能〔生〕故。設有生影，法爾何失？由此熏生自類〔影像〕。解云：理有不盡，如何羅漢緣煩惱？若不從見，\n以何種生？若有自種，羅漢應生染法種故。佛緣生死及二乘法，無彼種故，唯名獨影。爾時無生相分故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是護法正義，委如前說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是親光論師等義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是無\n著菩薩等義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上\n四門是馬鳴、堅慧等菩薩義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上三門明華嚴別教唯識道理，非起信論正所宗耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然其小乘全不說無影者，唯不云相分名為行相耳，以未說唯識故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與起信論宗異矣。說性淨不覺內熏義，為真如熏習義故。\n委如下知之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與起信論宗亦異，說根本無明熏習義及根本業識熏習義故。委如下記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與起信論亦稍異矣。真如熏習無斷絕時，常起自在用故，佛果亦熏。引文如下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄隆師等作如是說矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此亦與起信論稍異矣。許真如\n內熏義為佛性正因，豈無能生用哉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起信論宗，無漏之法亦有三種熏習，如下可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "象龍同云：生滅門中真如也，非真如門，以無熏生義故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "象云：亦通事識及梨耶業識，今據其本故但言業識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上略引一熏習名舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上即釋熏習名，此\n則喻也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且舉初，故云業識義耳，實亦在轉識現識\n等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此則本熏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此則新熏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賴耶三識及智\n\n識、相續識五種意矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上明法身矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十解初發心住名初發意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上一解了"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二解了"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上且述異，下自彰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上六識相應煩惱等障，伏斷位次耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255007A", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0255007A", "type": "mod", "text": "理一作事"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255007B", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0255007B", "type": "mod", "text": "事一作理"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255003", "type": "orig", "text": "天一作大"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255004", "type": "orig", "text": "素一作索"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255005", "type": "orig", "text": "奚一作爰"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255006", "type": "orig", "text": "若一作名"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255007A", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255007A", "type": "orig", "text": "理事一倒置"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255007B", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255007B", "type": "orig", "text": "理事一倒置"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256001", "type": "orig", "text": "空下一有真如二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256002 #note_star_1", "type": "orig", "text": "實一作如次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256003", "type": "orig", "text": "從論文無恐寫誤"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256004", "type": "orig", "text": "即一作而"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256005", "type": "orig", "text": "一無情字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256006", "type": "orig", "text": "有一作在"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256007", "type": "orig", "text": "變一作豈"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256008", "type": "orig", "text": "照上一有常字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0257001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0257001", "type": "orig", "text": "則一作門"}
{"id": null, "n": "0257002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0257002", "type": "orig", "text": "圓下一有妙字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0257003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0257003", "type": "orig", "text": "生下一有滅字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0257004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0257004", "type": "orig", "text": "唯說恐寫倒"}
{"id": null, "n": "0257005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0257005", "type": "orig", "text": "立一作土"}
{"id": null, "n": "0257006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0257006", "type": "orig", "text": "非字未審恐容在智字下歟"}
{"id": null, "n": "0258001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0258001", "type": "orig", "text": "身等一作等身"}
{"id": null, "n": "0258002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0258002", "type": "orig", "text": "故亦至動靜二十一行疑錯簡應在次頁上段五行何者之中間歟"}
{"id": null, "n": "0259001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0259001", "type": "orig", "text": "心上一有是字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0259002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0259002", "type": "orig", "text": "德一作種"}
{"id": null, "n": "0259003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0259003", "type": "orig", "text": "諸一作謂"}
{"id": null, "n": "0259004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0259004 #note_star_2", "type": "orig", "text": "直可未審下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0259005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0259005", "type": "orig", "text": "一一作二"}
{"id": null, "n": "0259006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0259006", "type": "orig", "text": "相一作眼"}
{"id": null, "n": "0260001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0260001", "type": "orig", "text": "兼一作通"}
{"id": null, "n": "0260002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0260002", "type": "orig", "text": "此初海東疏作然此"}
{"id": null, "n": "0260003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0260003", "type": "orig", "text": "以一作一"}
{"id": null, "n": "0260004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0260004", "type": "orig", "text": "初下疏有言字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0260005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0260005", "type": "orig", "text": "像下一有相字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261001", "type": "orig", "text": "設使一作說便"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261002", "type": "orig", "text": "即一作體"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261003", "type": "orig", "text": "亦一作都"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261004", "type": "orig", "text": "無位字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261005", "type": "orig", "text": "一無王字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261006", "type": "orig", "text": "又一作本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261007", "type": "orig", "text": "聞一作開"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262001", "type": "orig", "text": "五重唯識"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262002", "type": "orig", "text": "云下義林有識言二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262003", "type": "orig", "text": "一無心字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262004", "type": "orig", "text": "唯義林作但"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262005", "type": "orig", "text": "來幽贊作末"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262006", "type": "orig", "text": "必上義林有法字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262007", "type": "orig", "text": "三類境"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262008", "type": "orig", "text": "名一作若"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262009", "type": "orig", "text": "亦一作必"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262010", "type": "orig", "text": "繫疑擊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263001", "type": "orig", "text": "樞要無少字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263002", "type": "orig", "text": "八五一作五八"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263003", "type": "orig", "text": "託一作記"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263004", "type": "orig", "text": "生一作熏"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263005", "type": "orig", "text": "類下一有種字無影像二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263006", "type": "orig", "text": "許一作計"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263007", "type": "orig", "text": "是一作見"}
{"id": null, "n": "0264001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0264001", "type": "orig", "text": "十門唯識"}
{"id": null, "n": "0264002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0264002", "type": "orig", "text": "以一作似"}
{"id": null, "n": "0264003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0264003", "type": "orig", "text": "心下一有心字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0265001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0265001", "type": "orig", "text": "此下疑脫遮字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0265002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0265002", "type": "orig", "text": "論無增字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0266001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0266001", "type": "orig", "text": "後下論有相違二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0266002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0266002", "type": "orig", "text": "不疑既"}
{"id": null, "n": "0266003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0266003 #note_star_3", "type": "orig", "text": "持疑待次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0266004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0266004", "type": "orig", "text": "童疑章"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267001", "type": "orig", "text": "依疏作仗"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267002", "type": "orig", "text": "成下疏有重字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267003", "type": "orig", "text": "差一作曾"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267004", "type": "orig", "text": "染下論有法字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267005", "type": "orig", "text": "習下論有故字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267006", "type": "orig", "text": "現下疏有相字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267007", "type": "orig", "text": "返下疏有流字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267008", "type": "orig", "text": "藏下疏有故字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267009", "type": "orig", "text": "熏習義"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267010", "type": "orig", "text": "義疑又"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267011", "type": "orig", "text": "淨影以六相中前二相為七識之攝後四以屬事識"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267012", "type": "orig", "text": "雖疑離"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267013", "type": "orig", "text": "如疑始"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267014", "type": "orig", "text": "由疏作以"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268001", "type": "orig", "text": "令疑今"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268002", "type": "orig", "text": "取疑所或取相分別"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268003", "type": "orig", "text": "作因受果門"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268004", "type": "orig", "text": "從性成果門"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268005", "type": "orig", "text": "和合生果門"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268006", "type": "orig", "text": "意上疏有是上二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269001", "type": "orig", "text": "謂下論有諸字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269002", "type": "orig", "text": "力上論有熏習二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269003", "type": "orig", "text": "作下疏有於字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269004", "type": "orig", "text": "疏無依字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269005", "type": "orig", "text": "離疑雜"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269006", "type": "orig", "text": "童疑章"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269007", "type": "orig", "text": "不疑劣"}
{"id": null, "n": "0270001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0270001", "type": "orig", "text": "設論作故"}
{"id": null, "n": "0270002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0270002", "type": "orig", "text": "如上論有諸字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0270003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0270003", "type": "orig", "text": "論無心字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0270004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0270004", "type": "orig", "text": "報又論作報自又為"}
{"id": null, "n": "0270005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0270005", "type": "orig", "text": "是下疏有有字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0270006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0270006", "type": "orig", "text": "謂疏作唯"}
{"id": null, "n": "0271001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0271001", "type": "orig", "text": "具疑其"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272001", "type": "orig", "text": "離疑彼"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272002", "type": "orig", "text": "我人疏作人我"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272003", "type": "orig", "text": "即等作即是當人妄計"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0274001", "type": "orig", "text": "徧疑偏"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0274002", "type": "orig", "text": "身下論有以見法身四字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0274003", "type": "orig", "text": "故下疑脫無字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0274004", "type": "orig", "text": "□□疑性爾"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0274005", "type": "orig", "text": "生死疑性殊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0275001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0275001", "type": "orig", "text": "調疑謂"}
{"id": null, "n": "0275002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0275002", "type": "orig", "text": "相下疑脫應字"}
